{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e412e8f6-54b6-80f5-b905-1541b9e753ca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T13:09:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:06:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:06:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Um, I'm calling about my car. The city plow came through and, uh, totally plowed me in. There's a wicked wall of heavy stuff behind my tires."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. I'm sorry about that. Was this from the storm over the weekend, the snow that turned to rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, last weekend, Sunday into Monday. It was snow and then it went to rain, and then it all froze up solid. [line breaks up] ...so now it's like concrete."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there a little. You said it froze solid behind the car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, frozen solid. The plow went by yesterday and left a big bank right behind the car. I can't get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the car is on the street and the plow bank is blocking it in. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's right. And I was wondering if I can get some sand. For the ice, so I can at least walk to the car and not fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I can put in a request for sand. I'll need the address where you want it dropped off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, I'd rather not give it out on the phone. Can I just ask what the sand situation is? Is there a pile somewhere I can pick up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a pickup spot to give you off the top of my head. Let me put you on a quick hold and check with the yard. [pause] Okay, I'm back. They're telling me to have you call back with the location so a crew can be sent. Do you want to leave a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Helena Costa. And, uh, one more thing, just so you know why I'm so stuck. A neighbor asked me to watch a package for a few days, so I have to be around. I'm just not able to go anywhere anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll note that. Helena Costa, plowed in, needs sand, and I'll have someone call you back at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Great, thank you. That's all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Ms. Costa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
